  "Question": "In this figure \\(AB\\) is a diameter of a circle, centered at \\(O,\\) with radius \\(a.\\) A chord \\(AD\\) is drawn and extended to meet the tangent to the circle at \\(B,\\) in point \\(C.\\) Point \\(E\\) is taken on \\(AC\\) so that \\(AE=DC.\\) If the coordinates of \\(E\\) are \\((x,y),\\) then:\n\n[Figure 1](figures/1966_AMC_12_Q40_question_fig1.svg)",
